# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
# Working-tree checkout behavior stays controlled by core.autocrlf.
* text=auto

# Binary assets (belt and suspenders; git auto-detects most of these)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
